onstrates absence of the issue: the workflow's collapse_to_mesocosms averages each mesocosm's four campaign fluxes before any test, and the report explicitly states the repeated campaign records were averaged so that exactly one analysed value per mesocosm entered the exact two-sided Mann-Whitney U test (24 values, 12 warmed vs 12 ambient). No correlated repeated rows from the same unit entered the row-independent procedure; U = 141.0 is consistent with 12x12 mesocosm-level ranks.\",\"The lock's authorized_key_columns [\\\"mesocosm_id\\\"] follows from the declaration alone: it exactly matches the extracted token from the quoted declaration 'Independent unit column: mesocosm_id' in both v1 and v2 translation receipts, and mesocosm_id is present in the parsed logical header of data/input.csv.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"absence","lock_follows_declaration":true,"reasons":["The declared independent-unit column mesocosm_id is consistent with the frozen data: 24 distinct mesocosms (M01-M24) each appear exactly once per campaign week (3, 6, 9, 12), giving 96 rows, and each mesocosm carries a single unchanging treatment label across its four rows (12 ambient, 12 warmed), matching the whole-mesocosm randomisation described in both procedure arms.","The selected report demonstrates absence of the issue: the workflow's collapse_to_mesocosms averages each mesocosm's four campaign fluxes before any test, and the report explicitly states the repeated campaign records were averaged so that exactly one analysed value per mesocosm entered the exact two-sided Mann-Whitney U test (24 values, 12 warmed vs 12 ambient). No correlated repeated rows from the same unit entered the row-independent procedure; U = 141.0 is consistent with 12x12 mesocosm-level ranks.","The lock's authorized_key_columns [\"mesocosm_id\"] follows from the declaration alone: it exactly matches the extracted token from the quoted declaration 'Independent unit column: mesocosm_id' in both v1 and v2 translation receipts, and mesocosm_id is present in the parsed logical header of data/input.csv."]},"ttft_ms":4677,"ttft_stream_ms":1532,"time_to_request_ms":12,"type":"result","duration_ms":16224,"uuid":"dcf6db03-06df-40f5-b07d-36f59da305af"}
